# Restatement ledger (docs/standards/architecture.md rule 9) for --color-accent and
# --color-text-muted, owned by the light and dark blocks of
# packages/ui/src/tokens/tokens.css. Keyed to the four hex literals, not the token
# names: a consumer writing var(--color-accent) is not a carrier; a file writing the
# hex is one whatever it calls it.
#
# apps/web/public/favicon.svg carries all four literally because a favicon is fetched
# as a standalone document with no stylesheet context, so var() resolves to nothing
# there (#282; #424 redraws it). Excluded: docs/design/design-principles.md quotes
# #1d63bd twice as a dated decision record of #273, and
# docs/design/exploration/design-directions.html is a snapshot of the candidates
# considered, not a live surface.
owner: packages/ui/src/tokens/tokens.css
claim: the accent and muted-ink hex values, light and dark
sweep: #1d63bd|#58626d|#3987e5|#9aa5b1
scope: :!docs/tech-debt.md :!docs/friction-log.md :!docs/review-feedback.md
carrier: apps/web/public/favicon.svg
excluded: docs/design/design-principles.md
excluded: docs/design/exploration/design-directions.html
